\end{align*}
for $|\rho| < 1.$ By plugging $\rho = \frac{1}{2}, \cos \psi = \frac{1}{5},$ and $\sin \psi = \frac{2 \sqrt{6}}{5}$
in the above identity, we get that the required sum equals
\begin{align*}
\sum_{n = 0}^\infty \cos n \theta \cdot \frac{1}{2^n}
